<title>INDIA: India's RBI rejects all bids at repo auction.</title>
<headline>India's RBI rejects all bids at repo auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Tuesday it rejected all bids it received at a three-day repo auction of government securities held earlier in the day.</p>
<p>It gave no reasons for rejecting the bids.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received three bids for a total of 20 billion rupees and rejected all of them.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
